<http://ahip.org/demographics/ValueSet/ahip-sexual-orientation> a fhir:ValueSet ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:id [ fhir:v "ahip-sexual-orientation"] ; # 
  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-sexual-orientation</b></p><a name=\"ahip-sexual-orientation\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-sexual-orientation\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/20430005\">20430005</a></td><td>Straight or heterosexual (attracted to gender different from your own)​</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/38628009\">38628009</a></td><td>Gay or lesbian (attracted to the same gender as your own)​</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/42035005\">42035005</a></td><td>Bisexual (attracted to same gender as your own and gender different from your own)​</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/765288000\">765288000</a></td><td>Asexual (little or no attraction to any gender)</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/51431000087101\">51431000087101</a></td><td>Pansexual (attracted to any gender)​</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
  ] ; # 
